{"lyrics":"[00:08.92]Ooh-ooh-ooh\n[00:10.36](D-D-D-Danny Wolf)\n[00:10.88](Ayy, Dilip)\n[00:11.74]I'ma have a party tonight, go tell your friends, bitch (Go tell your friends, bitch)\n[00:15.62]You ain't gettin' money, then you ain't gettin' in, bitch (You ain't gettin' in, bitch)\n[00:19.50]Leave the heartbreak (At the crib), at the crib, bitch (Bitch)\n[00:22.52]Come to L.A, I can show you how I live, bitch (Show you how I live, bitch)\n[00:25.14]Bet I get her wetter wet (Wet), like a cruise ship (Cruise ship)\n[00:28.00]She been flexin' hard on my name, Terry Crews shit (Terry Crews shit)\n[00:31.12]No more parties in L.A. (L.A.), Kanye West shit\n[00:34.24]She do codeine with cocaine, that's the best shit (That's the best shit)\n[00:37.54]Think I found the love of my life (Where she at?), In a bottle (Hey), in a bottle (Hey)\n[00:43.56]Codeine up in my Sprite (Uh-huh), baby bottle (Hey), baby bottle (Hey)\n[00:49.66]I'm lookin' at my future like, \"Hi, hey\" (Ooh), you look so bright (Bling-bling)\n[00:56.02]Them VVS on my wrist so ice (Bling-bling) but somethin' in my chest don't feel right (Yeah)\n[01:01.88]Somethin' in my chest don't feel too good (Hey), thought I left my heartbreak in my old hood (Hey)\n[01:08.40]Ex-bitch in my phone, up to no good (Uh-huh), ole' gold diggin' bitch, you know you ain't gettin' no goods\n[01:14.94]I ain't really feelin' too good (Too good), the pills make me feel too good (Uh-huh)\n[01:20.98]I know you don't want me no more (No more, ayy), so I put my heart on the floor (On the floor), hey\n[01:27.36]I'ma have a party tonight, go tell your friends, bitch (Go tell your friends, bitch)\n[01:30.52]You ain't gettin' money, then you ain't gettin' in, bitch (You ain't gettin' in, bitch)\n[01:33.66]Leave the heartbreak (At the crib), at the crib, bitch (Bitch)\n[01:36.62]Come to L.A, I can show you how I live, bitch (Show you how I live, bitch)\n[01:40.48]Bet I get her wetter wet (Wet), like a cruise ship (Cruise ship)\n[01:42.80]She been flexin' hard on my name, Terry Crews shit (Terry Crews shit)\n[01:45.92]No more parties in L.A. (L.A.), Kanye West shit\n[01:49.02]She do codeine with cocaine, that's the best shit (That's the best shit)","words":[[8.92,10.28,"Ooh-ooh-ooh"],[10.36,10.74,"(D-D-D-Danny"],[10.78,10.84,"Wolf)"],[10.88,10.96,"(Ayy,"],[11.02,11.26,"Dilip)"],[11.74,11.86,"I'ma"],[12.08,12.24,"have"],[12.54,12.54,"a"],[12.64,12.78,"party"],[12.82,12.98,"tonight,"],[13.02,13.08,"go"],[13.2,13.44,"tell"],[13.5,13.6,"your"],[13.68,13.84,"friends,"],[14.04,14.16,"bitch"],[14.2,14.26,"(Go"],[14.38,14.54,"tell"],[14.58,14.64,"your"],[14.74,15.08,"friends,"],[15.18,15.54,"bitch)"],[15.62,15.72,"You"],[15.78,15.9,"ain't"],[15.96,16.16,"gettin'"],[16.34,16.62,"money,"],[16.72,16.8,"then"],[16.92,17.0,"you"],[17.22,17.4,"ain't"],[17.5,17.92,"gettin'"],[18.0,18.18,"in,"],[18.26,18.68,"bitch"],[18.72,18.76,"(You"],[18.8,18.88,"ain't"],[18.92,19.18,"gettin'"],[19.22,19.24,"in,"],[19.28,19.46,"bitch)"],[19.5,19.74,"Leave"],[19.84,19.9,"the"],[20.62,20.94,"heartbreak"],[21.14,21.16,"(At"],[21.2,21.24,"the"],[21.28,21.4,"crib),"],[21.5,21.6,"at"],[21.68,21.72,"the"],[21.76,21.88,"crib,"],[21.96,22.18,"bitch"],[22.24,22.48,"(Bitch)"],[22.52,22.64,"Come"],[22.76,22.78,"to"],[22.9,22.98,"L.A,"],[23.08,23.08,"I"],[23.12,23.2,"can"],[23.3,23.42,"show"],[23.54,23.62,"you"],[23.66,23.7,"how"],[23.76,23.76,"I"],[23.8,23.92,"live,"],[23.96,24.08,"bitch"],[24.12,24.2,"(Show"],[24.24,24.3,"you"],[24.34,24.5,"how"],[24.62,24.62,"I"],[24.82,24.98,"live,"],[25.02,25.1,"bitch)"],[25.14,25.18,"Bet"],[25.24,25.24,"I"],[25.28,25.4,"get"],[25.44,25.48,"her"],[25.66,25.88,"wetter"],[26.06,26.3,"wet"],[26.34,26.86,"(Wet),"],[26.94,27.08,"like"],[27.12,27.12,"a"],[27.18,27.44,"cruise"],[27.48,27.54,"ship"],[27.58,27.72,"(Cruise"],[27.76,27.86,"ship)"],[28.0,28.1,"She"],[28.18,28.26,"been"],[28.34,28.68,"flexin'"],[28.78,28.96,"hard"],[29.0,29.02,"on"],[29.06,29.08,"my"],[29.18,29.28,"name,"],[29.32,29.48,"Terry"],[29.52,2